# Account backend: configure AUTH_PEPPER as a Cloudflare Pages Secret.
# Generate a cryptographically random value of at least 32 bytes.
# Never place real secrets in this file or dist/.
# AUTH_PEPPER=
# DB is a Cloudflare D1 binding in wrangler.jsonc, not a public environment variable.
# pnpm dev automatically generates a local-only pepper under .local/.
# AI features remain demo-only; no AI key is required.
